{"id":"c1caa9c6c6dfe850","group":"14","path":"14/14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves.md","title":"Example — Sierpiński 空间的层逻辑不满足排中律","display":"Example — Sierpiński 空间的层逻辑不满足排中律","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves","aliases":["14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves"],"display":"Example — Sierpiński 空间的层逻辑不满足排中律","source_ref":"I.8, pp.50–56; II.8, pp.97–99","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]","[[14-df-boolean-topos]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-df-topological-open-site]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Example — Sierpiński 空间的层逻辑不满足排中律"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.8, pp.50–56; II.8, pp.97–99"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91189e210bff4156\" href=\"?note=91189e210bff4156\" title=\"14-df-heyting-algebra\">14-df-heyting-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"78d84752064c9948\" href=\"?note=78d84752064c9948\" title=\"14-df-boolean-topos\">14-df-boolean-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a8105e59309bc16\" href=\"?note=3a8105e59309bc16\" title=\"14-df-topological-open-site\">14-df-topological-open-site</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(X=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\{\\varnothing,\\{1\\},X\\}\">\\(\\tau=\\{\\varnothing,\\{1\\},X\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\tau\">\\(U,V\\in\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau\">\\(\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau\\)</span> 为下式定义的开内部函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(X)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(X)\\)</span> 中的终层为各开集上唯一元素的层，开集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 对应子终层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_U\">\\(S_U\\)</span>；其以下分量及限制由包含、唯一空函数共同指定。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*:=\\varnothing\">\\(*:=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{W\\in\\tau\\mid W\\subseteq A\\}\\qquad(A\\subseteq X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{W\\in\\tau\\mid W\\subseteq A\\}\\qquad(A\\subseteq X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_U(V)=\\{*\\mid V\\subseteq U\\},\\qquad U\\Rightarrow V=\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau((X\\setminus U)\\cup V),\\qquad\\neg U=\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau(X\\setminus U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_U(V)=\\{*\\mid V\\subseteq U\\},\\qquad U\\Rightarrow V=\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau((X\\setminus U)\\cup V),\\qquad\\neg U=\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau(X\\setminus U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\{1\\}=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\{1\\}\\cup\\neg\\{1\\}=\\{1\\}\\ne X,\\qquad\\neg\\neg\\{1\\}=X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\{1\\}=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\{1\\}\\cup\\neg\\{1\\}=\\{1\\}\\ne X,\\qquad\\neg\\neg\\{1\\}=X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho^V_{S_U,W}:=\\{(*,*)\\mid V\\subseteq U\\}\\quad(W,V\\in\\tau,\\ W\\subseteq V),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(S_U,X,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho^V_{S_U,W}:=\\{(*,*)\\mid V\\subseteq U\\}\\quad(W,V\\in\\tau,\\ W\\subseteq V),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(S_U,X,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_U\">\\(S_U\\)</span> 是层：开覆盖各成员都包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 当且仅当其并包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>。任意子终层的“有截面的开集”在向下限制及覆盖并下封闭，故唯一对应其并得到的开集。由此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(1)\\cong\\tau\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(1)\\cong\\tau\\)</span>，运算为交、并和上式的开集蕴含。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\setminus\\{1\\}=\\{0\\}\">\\(X\\setminus\\{1\\}=\\{0\\}\\)</span> 没有非空开内部，故计算如式。开内部构造已列入 Assertion，移去 Remark 后仍能计算全部开集运算。一个子对象没有补已经足以排除 Boolean 性；这给出一个完全有限且可直接核查的内部直觉主义逻辑例子。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.8, pp.50–56; II.8, pp.97–99。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"91189e210bff4156","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-boolean-topos","status":"resolved","id":"78d84752064c9948","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-boolean-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-open-site","status":"resolved","id":"3a8105e59309bc16","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-open-site]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=\\{\\varnothing,\\{1\\},X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"U,V\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"S_U","display":false},{"tex":"*:=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{W\\in\\tau\\mid W\\subseteq A\\}\\qquad(A\\subseteq X).","display":true},{"tex":"S_U(V)=\\{*\\mid V\\subseteq U\\},\\qquad U\\Rightarrow V=\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau((X\\setminus U)\\cup V),\\qquad\\neg U=\\operatorname{Int}_\\tau(X\\setminus U).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\{1\\}=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\{1\\}\\cup\\neg\\{1\\}=\\{1\\}\\ne X,\\qquad\\neg\\neg\\{1\\}=X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho^V_{S_U,W}:=\\{(*,*)\\mid V\\subseteq U\\}\\quad(W,V\\in\\tau,\\ W\\subseteq V),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(S_U,X,\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"S_U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}(1)\\cong\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"X\\setminus\\{1\\}=\\{0\\}","display":false}],"bytes":2395,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves|ex-201 — Sierpiński 空间的层逻辑不满足排中律]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sierpinski-nonboolean-sheaves|ex-201 — Sierpiński 空间的层逻辑不满足排中律]]"}],"outgoing":["f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","91189e210bff4156","78d84752064c9948","d3923e299ec2ec5a","3a8105e59309bc16"]}